        (
            c.template
            name: "Receiver"
            sections: list {
                (
                    c.section
                    text: """
                        /* Receiver / ReceiverVal -- the one reading end of a channel (sync.z), one
                           copy per value type; both classes are this template, @@P0@@ their one type
                           parameter. It owns the channel's block (_Z_CHAN.inc) with whatever Senders
                           it made. `receive` and `tryReceive` answer an option built by the
                           instance's own @@SOME.<m>@@ / @@NONE.<m>@@ helpers. */
