                (
                    c.section
                    text: """
                        /* ReceiverIter / ReceiverIterVal -- a Receiver walked by `for each`: each
                           call waits for the next value, and answers none once every Sender is gone
                           and nothing is left (sync.z). It reaches the channel's block through the
                           Receiver it was made from, which it keeps locked. */
                        typedef struct z_@@NAME@@_t {
                            z_chan* b;
                        } z_@@NAME@@_t;

